WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.369
-With Donald Trump's
presidential reelection campaign

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:04.604
suing to stop Michigan

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.038
and Pennsylvania's
ballot counts,

00:00:06.038 --> 00:00:08.208
he is asking his supporters
to take action.

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:10.443
Here, to talk about it,
is Trump supporter

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:12.445
and rapper Lil Doof.

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.347
[ Mellow hip hop plays ]

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:15.815
-Yeah.

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:19.084
It's your man Lil Doof.

00:00:19.084 --> 00:00:21.121
And you know
what I always say.

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:24.724
Anyone who makes me pay a lot
of taxes can't have my vote.

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.727
♪ It's like I ♪
-Whoa, whoa. Sorry, wait, uh --

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.495
-What?
-It's just, um, sorry,

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:31.965
but, you, uh,
you always say that?

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:33.432
-Yeah.

00:00:33.432 --> 00:00:35.034
Yeah, I always say that.

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:37.903
I'm like -- I'm always talking
about that, yeah.

00:00:37.903 --> 00:00:39.205
-Oh.

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:41.741
Okay. Sorry.
Go ahead.

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:43.443
♪♪

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.044
-Yeah.

00:00:45.044 --> 00:00:47.579
It's your boy Lil Doof.

00:00:47.579 --> 00:00:49.181
Coming straight atcha.

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:52.452
America First Records
taking over.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:53.886
Come on. Let's go.

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:56.322
♪ It's like I ♪
-Sorry.

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:57.390
-What?

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.424
-Sorry to interrupt.

00:00:58.424 --> 00:01:00.660
Did you say
America First Records?

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.429
-Yeah.
I'm part of the AF squad.

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:04.931
-Oh.

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:07.333
So that's a record label
that's...

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:09.435
-Owned and operated
by Donald Trump.

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:10.436
-Yeah.
You heard of it?

00:01:10.436 --> 00:01:12.238
-No.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.039
I just assumed
because of the name.

00:01:14.039 --> 00:01:16.442
-Oh. Okay.

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:18.444
I thought maybe
you were like a fan --

00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:20.647
-No.

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:22.181
-Alright.
Alright.

00:01:22.181 --> 00:01:24.417
Okay.
Uh, let's bring that track back.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:25.551
♪♪

00:01:25.551 --> 00:01:28.020
Unh, yeah.

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:30.155
It's your boy Lil Doof.

00:01:30.155 --> 00:01:32.525
America First Records.

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:33.893
Come on, now.

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:35.561
♪ When I say, "Stop" ♪

00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:37.263
♪ You say, "The vote" ♪

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:38.798
♪ Stop ♪

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.966
Hey.

00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:42.535
-It's just, um,

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:45.938
no one's here, so,
no one's going to answer you.

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:49.242
-Wait, not even these guys
are going to like...?

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:53.746
-No, no one here
is going to do that.

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:54.813
-Okay.

00:01:54.813 --> 00:01:57.549
[ Crying ]

00:01:57.549 --> 00:01:59.618
I don't even need
them like that.

00:01:59.618 --> 00:02:02.121
-Oh, oh, Lil -- Lil Doof.

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:04.157
Lil Doof, are --
are you alright?

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:06.692
-Being a rapper is hard,
you know?

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:09.462
-No, I do not know.

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:12.164
-I don't even want
to be doing this.

00:02:12.164 --> 00:02:14.133
I thought this would be easy.

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:15.702
Trump told me he needed a rapper

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:17.470
to endorse him
to get the Black vote

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.272
and that, if I did that, he'd
give me a buttload of money.

00:02:20.272 --> 00:02:22.241
-Aw. Oh, my God.
That's terrible.

00:02:22.241 --> 00:02:23.375
I'm so sorry.

00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:25.878
-I told him that I was not
a good rapper

00:02:25.878 --> 00:02:29.182
and that was not a good
way to get the Black vote

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:33.553
and that I am not musical,
in any way, but he insisted.

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:35.221
He even wrote all my rhymes.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:37.222
-Oh, man.
Trump wrote your rhymes?

00:02:37.222 --> 00:02:39.125
-Yeah. You'd have been able
to figure that out

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.660
because, later in the song,

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:41.960
I rhyme Mitch McConnell

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:43.395
with Rosie O'Donnell.

00:02:43.395 --> 00:02:45.764
-Aw. That's a shame.
I bet he even

00:02:45.764 --> 00:02:49.835
made you change your name
to Lil Doof?

00:02:49.835 --> 00:02:52.104
-No, it's Lil Doof.

00:02:52.104 --> 00:02:53.405
Of the Pennsylvania Doofs.

00:02:53.405 --> 00:02:54.540
-Oh!

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.342
I will have to

00:02:56.342 --> 00:02:57.710
take your word on that.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.278
Look, you don't have
to keep supporting Trump,

00:02:59.278 --> 00:03:01.714
if you don't want to.

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:02.715
-I don't?

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:04.050
-No!

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:07.120
Lil Doof, you're your own man.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.188
-Oh. Thanks, Seth.

00:03:09.188 --> 00:03:11.957
Hey, you know what?

00:03:11.957 --> 00:03:13.593
I'd like to take
this opportunity

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:17.830
to officially retire
from the rap game.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.732
And, hey, Seth.

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:21.868
-Yeah, Lil Doof?

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:23.435
-♪ You know what they say ♪

00:03:23.435 --> 00:03:24.704
-Yeah, I'm going
to need you to leave.

00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:25.704
I'm going to need you
to go now.

00:03:25.704 --> 00:03:27.272
-Yeah, sure.
I understand that.

00:03:27.272 --> 00:03:28.774
-Lil Doof, everybody!

00:03:28.774 --> 00:03:30.577
We'll be right back
with Demi Lovato.

